. Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 128 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 23.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 78 x 39 x 64 (w x h x d), centred at x -4, z -2\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default): untouched node\n- `depleted`: mined out: smaller broken chunks and gravel\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `hit` | 0.3 | once | short shake when struck (both sets) |\n"}